# Counterexample (paper, appendix sec:fr-counter): DAG-structured and fully realizable, but not locally
# feasible: the two sentences on the row U=1 contradict each other, so D_LCN forces P(U)=0 (exact [0,0]),
# which no local credal set encodes (CVE over the strong extension: [0,1]).
s1: 0.0 <= P(U) <= 1.0
s2: 0.8 <= P(X | U) <= 1.0
s3: 0.0 <= P(X | U) <= 0.2
s4: 0.3 <= P(X | !U) <= 0.6
